<p id="radix-ID" class="text-sm text-slate-400">A portable .pld file with the selected items, their data, and open-format sidecars where a format exists. Import it into any Petrolord account for an independent copy.</p></div><div class="space-y-2"><label class="block text-xs text-slate-400">Package name<input data-testid="pld-name" class="mt-1 w-full rounded bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 px-2 py-1 text-sm text-slate-200" placeholder="For example: KETA field handover" value="KETA TYPE-1"></label><div class="relative"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 absolute left-1.5 top-2 text-slate-500"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><input data-testid="pld-search" class="w-full rounded bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 pl-6 pr-2 py-1 text-xs text-slate-200" placeholder="Filter by name" value=""></div><div class="space-y-1.5"><div class="rounded border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950/40"><div class="px-2 py-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 border-b border-slate-800 flex items-center "><span>Wells <span class="text-slate-600">(1 of 2)</span></span></div><div class="max-h-36 overflow-y-auto"><label class="flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1 text-xs text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-800 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" data-testid="pld-well-w1" class="accent-cyan-500" checked=""><span class="truncate">KETA TYPE-1</span></label><label class="flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1 text-xs text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-800 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" data-testid="pld-well-w2" class="accent-cyan-500"><span class="truncate">AKOMA-2</span><span class="ml-auto text-[10px] text-slate-500">shared</span></label></div></div><div class="rounded border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950/40"><div class="px-2 py-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate